WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:01.801
-Performing "America,"

00:00:01.801 --> 00:00:04.100
please welcome Will Swenson

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:06.334
and the cast
of "A Beautiful Noise,"

00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:07.701
the Neil Diamond musical.

00:00:07.701 --> 00:00:10.868
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

00:00:12.501 --> 00:00:14.167
-It was more than 100 years ago

00:00:14.167 --> 00:00:16.133
that a little girl made
the great voyage

00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:18.334
-♪ Ooh ooh ooh ooh
ooh ooh ooh ♪
-to a place called America.

00:00:18.334 --> 00:00:20.934
That little girl
was my grandmother.

00:00:20.934 --> 00:00:23.100
She and her daughter Rose
inspired me

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:26.234
to achieve everything that I've
achieved in my life.

00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:28.367
Her courage will never be
forgotten.

00:00:28.367 --> 00:00:30.501
This one is for her.

00:00:30.501 --> 00:00:32.767
-♪ Far ♪

00:00:32.767 --> 00:00:36.501
♪ We've been traveling far ♪

00:00:36.501 --> 00:00:39.200
♪ Without a home ♪

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:43.067
♪ But not without a star ♪

00:00:45.467 --> 00:00:47.634
♪ Free ♪

00:00:47.634 --> 00:00:50.634
♪ Only want to be free ♪

00:00:51.534 --> 00:00:54.200
♪ We huddle close ♪

00:00:55.267 --> 00:00:59.734
♪ And hang on to a dream ♪

00:01:00.868 --> 00:01:04.801
-♪ On the boats
and on the planes ♪

00:01:04.801 --> 00:01:08.501
♪ They're coming to America ♪

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:12.200
♪ Never looking back again ♪

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:15.534
